msgstr "የተጠቃሚ ስም"

#: oobe.rs:906
msgid "Password"
msgstr "የይለፍ ቃል"

#: oobe.rs:907
msgid "Confirm Password"
msgstr "የይለፍ ቃሉን ያረጋግጡ"

#: oobe.rs:908
msgid "Log In Automatically"
msgstr "ራስ-ሰር መግቢያ"

#: oobe.rs:908
msgid "Skip the login screen when the computer starts"
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩ ሲጀምር የመግቢያ ገጹን ዝለል"

#: oobe.rs:915
msgid "Existing Home Folders"
msgstr "ያሉ የቤት አቃፊዎች"

#: oobe.rs:915
msgid "Use the same username to keep using a folder kept from a previous installation."
msgstr "የቀድሞውን ጭነት አቃፊ መጠቀም ለመቀጠል ተመሳሳዩን የተጠቃሚ ስም ይጠቀሙ።"

#: oobe.rs:919
msgid "Use"
msgstr "ተጠቀም"

#: oobe.rs:929
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "የላቀ"

#: oobe.rs:930
msgid "Computer Name"
msgstr "የኮምፒውተር ስም"

#: oobe.rs:932
msgid "Set a Root Password"
msgstr "የroot የይለፍ ቃል አዘጋጅ"

#: oobe.rs:933
msgid "Allows logging in as root directly. Without it, use sudo with your own password."
msgstr "በቀጥታ እንደ root መግባትን ይፈቅዳል። ያለ እሱ sudoን ከራስዎ የይለፍ ቃል ጋር ይጠቀሙ።"

#: oobe.rs:937
msgid "Root Password"
msgstr "የroot የይለፍ ቃል"

#: oobe.rs:938
msgid "Confirm Root Password"
msgstr "የroot የይለፍ ቃሉን ያረጋግጡ"

#: oobe.rs:962
msgid "Enter your name."
msgstr "ስምዎን ያስገቡ።"

#: oobe.rs:964
msgid "Choose a username."
msgstr "የተጠቃሚ ስም ይምረጡ።"

#: oobe.rs:966
msgid "This username is already used by the system."
msgstr "ይህ የተጠቃሚ ስም አስቀድሞ በስርዓቱ ጥቅም ላይ ነው።"

#: oobe.rs:969
msgid "This username is reserved by the system."
msgstr "ይህ የተጠቃሚ ስም ለስርዓቱ የተያዘ ነው።"

#: oobe.rs:971
msgid "Usernames use lowercase letters, digits, - and _, and start with a letter."
msgstr "የተጠቃሚ ስሞች ትንንሽ የላቲን ፊደላት፣ አሃዞች፣ - እና _ ይይዛሉ፣ በፊደልም ይጀምራሉ።"

#: oobe.rs:974
msgid "Choose a password."
msgstr "የይለፍ ቃል ይምረጡ።"

#: oobe.rs:976
msgid "The passwords do not match."
msgstr "የይለፍ ቃሎቹ አይዛመዱም።"

#: oobe.rs:978
msgid "The computer name may contain letters, digits and dashes."
msgstr "የኮምፒውተሩ ስም ፊደላት፣ አሃዞች እና ሰረዞች ሊይዝ ይችላል።"

#: oobe.rs:980
msgid "Enter the root password twice."
msgstr "የroot የይለፍ ቃሉን ሁለት ጊዜ ያስገቡ።"

#: oobe.rs:986
msgid "Tip: a password with 8 or more characters is much safer."
msgstr "ጠቃሚ ምክር: 8 ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ቁምፊዎች ያለው የይለፍ ቃል በጣም ደህንነቱ የተጠበቀ ነው።"

#: oobe.rs:1066
msgid "Account"
msgstr "መለያ"

#: oobe.rs:1084
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "ጨለማ"

#: oobe.rs:1084
msgid "Light"
msgstr "ብርሃን"

#: oobe.rs:1092
msgid "Make It Yours"
msgstr "የራስዎ ያድርጉት"

#: oobe.rs:1092
msgid "Pick a style, an accent color and a wallpaper. You see every change right away."
msgstr "ቅጥ፣ የአጽንዖት ቀለም እና የግድግዳ ወረቀት ይምረጡ። እያንዳንዱ ለውጥ ወዲያውኑ ይታያል።"

#: oobe.rs:1095
msgid "Style"
msgstr "ቅጥ"

#: oobe.rs:1115
msgid "Accent Color"
msgstr "የአጽንዖት ቀለም"

#: oobe.rs:1158
msgid "Wallpaper"
msgstr "የግድግዳ ወረቀት"

#: oobe.rs:1202
msgid "Customize"
msgstr "አብጅ"

#: oobe.rs:1209
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "ግላዊነት"

#: oobe.rs:1209
msgid "Choose which features may use information about you. You can change this at any time in Settings."
msgstr "የትኞቹ ባህሪያት ስለእርስዎ መረጃ መጠቀም እንደሚችሉ ይምረጡ። ይህን በማንኛውም ጊዜ በቅንብሮች ውስጥ መቀየር ይችላሉ።"

#: oobe.rs:1212
msgid "Location Services"
msgstr "የአካባቢ አገልግሎቶች"

#: oobe.rs:1213
msgid "Allows apps such as Maps and Weather to find your approximate location, using nearby Wi-Fi networks."
msgstr "እንደ Maps እና Weather ያሉ መተግበሪያዎች በአቅራቢያ ባሉ የWi-Fi አውታረ መረቦች ግምታዊ አካባቢዎን እንዲያገኙ ያስችላል።"

#: oobe.rs:1217
msgid "Automatic Time Zone"
msgstr "ራስ-ሰር የሰዓት ሰቅ"

#: oobe.rs:1218
msgid "Uses your location to keep the time zone right when you travel."
msgstr "በጉዞ ላይ የሰዓት ሰቁን ትክክል ለማድረግ አካባቢዎን ይጠቀማል።"

#: oobe.rs:1251
msgid "_Finish Setup"
msgstr "ማዋቀሩን ጨርስ(_F)"

#: oobe.rs:1256
msgid "Your Disk Is Encrypted"
msgstr "ዲስክዎ ተመስጥሯል"

#: oobe.rs:1256
msgid "Your data is protected. The passphrase is asked every time the computer starts."
msgstr "ውሂብዎ የተጠበቀ ነው። ኮምፒውተሩ በጀመረ ቁጥር የይለፍ ሐረግ ይጠየቃል።"

#: oobe.rs:1259
msgid "Disk Encryption"
msgstr "የዲስክ ምስጠራ"

#: oobe.rs:1259
msgid "Encryption protects your data if the computer is lost or stolen."
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩ ቢጠፋ ወይም ቢሰረቅ ምስጠራ ውሂብዎን ይጠብቃል።"

#: oobe.rs:1261
msgid "Not available on this installation"
msgstr "በዚህ ጭነት ላይ አይገኝም"

#: oobe.rs:1267
msgid "Encryption protects your files if the computer is lost or stolen. Without the passphrase, nobody can read the disk."
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩ ቢጠፋ ወይም ቢሰረቅ ምስጠራ ፋይሎችዎን ይጠብቃል። ያለ የይለፍ ሐረጉ ማንም ዲስኩን ማንበብ አይችልም።"

#: oobe.rs:1270
msgid "Encrypt the Disk"
msgstr "ዲስኩን መስጥር"

#: oobe.rs:1271
msgid "The passphrase is asked every time the computer starts."
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩ በጀመረ ቁጥር የይለፍ ሐረግ ይጠየቃል።"

#: oobe.rs:1279
msgid "Encryption starts at the next restart"
msgstr "ምስጠራ በሚቀጥለው ዳግም ጅምር ይጀምራል"

#: oobe.rs:1280
msgid "Your disk is then encrypted in the background while you use the computer. If the passphrase is lost, the data cannot be recovered by anyone."
msgstr "ከዚያም ኮምፒውተሩን እየተጠቀሙ ሳሉ ዲስኩ ከበስተጀርባ ይመሰጠራል። የይለፍ ሐረጉ ቢጠፋ ማንም ውሂቡን መመለስ አይችልም።"

#: oobe.rs:1377
msgid "Preparing MAN"
msgstr "MAN በመዘጋጀት ላይ"

#: oobe.rs:1378
msgid "Getting everything ready…"
msgstr "ሁሉንም በማዘጋጀት ላይ…"

#: oobe.rs:1383
msgid "_Reboot"
msgstr "እንደገና አስጀምር(_R)"

#: oobe.rs:1385
msgid "_Go Back"
msgstr "ተመለስ(_G)"

#: oobe.rs:1399
msgid "Preparing"
msgstr "በመዘጋጀት ላይ"

#: oobe.rs:1412
msgid "Setup Log"
msgstr "የማዋቀር ምዝግብ"

#: oobe.rs:1444
msgid "All Done!"
msgstr "ሁሉም ዝግጁ ነው!"

#: oobe.rs:1454
msgid "Something Went Wrong"
msgstr "የሆነ ችግር ተፈጥሯል"

#: snapshots.rs:84
msgid "Daily"
msgstr "ዕለታዊ"

#: snapshots.rs:85
msgid "Before update"
msgstr "ከዝማኔ በፊት"

#: snapshots.rs:86
msgid "Before restore"
msgstr "ከመመለስ በፊት"

#: snapshots.rs:87
msgid "Before reinstall"
msgstr "እንደገና ከመጫን በፊት"

#: snapshots.rs:88
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "በእጅ"

#: snapshots.rs:123
msgid "No snapshots yet"
msgstr "እስካሁን ምንም ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂ የለም"

#: snapshots.rs:123
msgid "Create one before making big changes to the system."
msgstr "በስርዓቱ ላይ ትልቅ ለውጦችን ከማድረግዎ በፊት አንድ ይፍጠሩ።"

#: snapshots.rs:133
msgid "Restore…"
msgstr "መልስ…"

#: snapshots.rs:135
msgid "Delete Snapshot"
msgstr "ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂውን ሰርዝ"

#: snapshots.rs:160
msgid "{free} free of {size}. System, home and snapshots share this space; snapshots only use space for what changed since they were taken."
msgstr "ከ{size} ውስጥ {free} ባዶ ነው። ስርዓቱ፣ የቤት አቃፊዎች እና ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂዎች ይህን ቦታ ይጋራሉ፤ ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂዎች ቦታ የሚይዙት ከተፈጠሩ በኋላ ለተለወጠው ብቻ ነው።"

#: snapshots.rs:220
msgid "_OK"
msgstr "እሺ(_O)"

#: snapshots.rs:229
msgid "Create Snapshot"
msgstr "ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂ ፍጠር"

#: snapshots.rs:229
msgid "Save the current state of the system. Your personal files in Home are not included."
msgstr "የስርዓቱን የአሁኑን ሁኔታ ያስቀምጣል። በቤት አቃፊ ውስጥ ያሉ የግል ፋይሎች አይካተቱም።"

#: snapshots.rs:230
msgid "Description, for example “Before installing drivers”"
msgstr "መግለጫ፣ ለምሳሌ “ሾፌሮችን ከመጫን በፊት”"

#: snapshots.rs:233
msgid "_Create"
msgstr "ፍጠር(_C)"

#: snapshots.rs:245
msgid "Manual snapshot"
msgstr "በእጅ የተፈጠረ ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂ"

#: snapshots.rs:253
msgid "Delete Snapshot?"
msgstr "ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂው ይሰረዝ?"

#: snapshots.rs:254
msgid "“{description}” from {date} will be deleted permanently."
msgstr "የ{date} “{description}” በቋሚነት ይሰረዛል።"

#: snapshots.rs:257
msgid "_Delete"
msgstr "ሰርዝ(_D)"

#: snapshots.rs:271
msgid "Restore This Snapshot?"
msgstr "ይህ ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂ ይመለስ?"

#: snapshots.rs:272
msgid ""
"The system will return to “{description}” from {date} after a restart. Your personal files in Home are not changed.\n"
"\n"
"The current system is saved as a snapshot first, so this can be undone."
msgstr ""
"እንደገና ከተጀመረ በኋላ ስርዓቱ ወደ {date} “{description}” ይመለሳል። የግል ፋይሎችዎ አይለወጡም።\n"
"\n"
"የአሁኑ ስርዓት መጀመሪያ እንደ ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂ ስለሚቀመጥ ይህ ሊቀለበስ ይችላል።"

#: snapshots.rs:278
msgid "_Restore"
msgstr "መልስ(_R)"

#: snapshots.rs:291
msgid "Restart to Finish Restoring"
msgstr "መመለሱን ለመጨረስ እንደገና ያስጀምሩ"

#: snapshots.rs:292
msgid "Restart _Later"
msgstr "በኋላ እንደገና አስጀምር(_L)"

#: snapshots.rs:293
msgid "Restart _Now"
msgstr "አሁን እንደገና አስጀምር(_N)"

#: snapshots.rs:306
msgid "Snapshots"
msgstr "ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂዎች"

#: snapshots.rs:317
msgid "Restore Points"
msgstr "የመመለሻ ነጥቦች"

#: snapshots.rs:318
msgid "Snapshots save the state of the operating system. Restoring one brings the system back to that moment, which helps after a bad update or configuration change. Your personal files in Home are never touched."
msgstr "ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂዎች የስርዓተ ክወናውን ሁኔታ ያስቀምጣሉ። አንዱን መመለስ ስርዓቱን ወደዚያ ቅጽበት ይመልሰዋል፣ ይህም ከተበላሸ ዝማኔ ወይም የቅንብር ለውጥ በኋላ ይረዳል። የግል ፋይሎችዎ በጭራሽ አይነኩም።"

#: snapshots.rs:325
msgid "Automatic Snapshots"
msgstr "ራስ-ሰር ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂዎች"

#: snapshots.rs:326
msgid "Daily Snapshots"
msgstr "ዕለታዊ ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂዎች"

#: snapshots.rs:326
msgid "Once a day while the computer is on"
msgstr "ኮምፒውተሩ ሲበራ በቀን አንድ ጊዜ"

#: snapshots.rs:328
msgid "Daily Snapshots to Keep"
msgstr "የሚቆዩ ዕለታዊ ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂዎች"

#: snapshots.rs:329
msgid "Before Software Updates"
msgstr "ከሶፍትዌር ዝማኔዎች በፊት"

#: snapshots.rs:329
msgid "Taken automatically when packages are installed, upgraded or removed"
msgstr "ጥቅሎችን ሲጫኑ፣ ሲያልቁ ወይም ሲያስወግዱ በራስ-ሰር ይወሰዳሉ"

#: snapshots.rs:331
msgid "Update Snapshots to Keep"
msgstr "የሚቆዩ የዝማኔ ቅጽበታዊ ቅጂዎች"

#: snapshots.rs:337
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "ማከማቻ"

#: snapshots.rs:338
msgid "Disk Space"
msgstr "የዲስክ ቦታ"

#: snapshots.rs:342
msgid "If MAN Does Not Start"
msgstr "MAN ካልጀመረ"

#: snapshots.rs:343
msgid "Choose “Restore a MAN snapshot” in the boot menu to bring back a working system."
